   "The 'Film Production Courses' heading prints '6-9 units required' for the whole choice, not per option, so each option block's stated is null. Option 1 = 6 units; Option 2 = FILM 32 + FILM 32L plus either FILM 33 + FILM 33L (9 units) or FILM 34 + FILM 34L (8 units). Option 2 was split into two blocks, one for each nested sequence, so FILM 32 and FILM 32L appear in both.",
